    aat:headline "宝玉挨打";
    aat:metadataEndLine 152;
    aat:metadataStartLine 152;
    aat:raw """[#event-baoyu-beaten.event]
== 宝玉挨打
// ==========================================
// 第五卷：核心因果事件流
// ==========================================
// 【动态建模】：事件作为枢纽节点，连接人物、空间与因果。

贾政对贾宝玉进行的一次极端暴力惩戒。
起因涉及：结交优伶蒋玉菡、金钏儿跳井事件。

* 发起者：xref:贾政[rel=participate, role=initiator]
* 受害者：xref:贾宝玉[rel=participate, role=victim]
* 庇护者：xref:贾母[rel=participate, role=intervener] 与 xref:wang-furen-rong[王夫人, rel=participate, role=intervener] 强制终止了惩戒。

""";
    aat:relativePath "红楼梦结构图谱.adoc";
    aat:role "event";
    aat:startLine 152;
    rel:participate <urn:aat:doc:6718943a5a553f839a956b046c039475f8a5aa8c1d93edbe1b554522354ac42f#heading-l37-o0>, <urn:aat:doc:6718943a5a553f839a956b046c039475f8a5aa8c1d93edbe1b554522354ac42f#heading-l48-o0>, <urn:aat:doc:6718943a5a553f839a956b046c039475f8a5aa8c1d93edbe1b554522354ac42f#heading-l52-o0>, <urn:aat:doc:6718943a5a553f839a956b046c039475f8a5aa8c1d93edbe1b554522354ac42f#heading-l74-o0>.
<urn:aat:doc:6718943a5a553f839a956b046c039475f8a5aa8c1d93edbe1b554522354ac42f#heading-l166-o0> a aat:Heading;
    aat:addressLabel "event-raid-on-garden";
    aat:childOrder 10;
    aat:contentEndLine 174;
    aat:contentStartLine 168;
    aat:documentOrder 32;
    aat:endLine 175;
    aat:headingLevel 1;
    aat:headingLine 167;
    aat:headline "抄检大观园";
    aat:metadataEndLine 166;
    aat:metadataStartLine 166;
    aat:raw """[#event-raid-on-garden.event]
== 抄检大观园
贾府内部自相残杀的标志性转折点，标志着大观园乌托邦的破灭。

* 导火索：在大观园内发现违禁物品“绣春囊”。
* 决策者：xref:wang-furen-rong[王夫人, rel=participate, role=initiator]
* 执行者：xref:王熙凤[rel=participate, role=executor]
* 受害节点：直接导致了 xref:晴雯[rel=cause-death] 的死亡，以及 xref:司棋[rel=cause-expel] 等人被逐。
* 结果：加速了 xref:荣国府[rel=cause-decline] 的全面崩溃。

""";
    aat:relativePath "红楼梦结构图谱.adoc";
    aat:role "event";
    aat:startLine 166;
    rel:cause-decline <urn:aat:doc:6718943a5a553f839a956b046c039475f8a5aa8c1d93edbe1b554522354ac42f#heading-l23-o0>;
    rel:participate <urn:aat:doc:6718943a5a553f839a956b046c039475f8a5aa8c1d93edbe1b554522354ac42f#heading-l52-o0>, <urn:aat:doc:6718943a5a553f839a956b046c039475f8a5aa8c1d93edbe1b554522354ac42f#heading-l86-o0>.
